      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlands_Ranch%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Confluence Park, where Cherry Creek and the South Platte River meet, offers kayakers rapids and panoramic views of downtown Denver.",
